  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional master program for integrated water resources management. WaterNet has become an active and well established actor in capacity strengthening in the regional water sector. Financed also by the Netherlands. As per 1 July 2009, the WaterNet Trust will be agreement partner. This was already agreed in the agreement signed in 2005.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionalt masterprogram kring integrerad vattenresursf&#xF6;rvaltning. Har blivit en mkt aktiv och framst&#xE5;ende akt&#xF6;r inom kapacitetsf&#xF6;rst&#xE4;rkning i vattensektorn i regionen. Finansierat ocks&#xE5; av Holland. Avtalspart kommer att bytas 1 juli 2009 till WaterNet Trust, enl &#xF6;verenskommelse redan n&#xE4;r avtalet skrevs 2005.</narrative>
  </description>
